  "title": "Provider-neutral harness seam and the dsh adapter",
  "summary": "Adds a provider-neutral `harness` module (the `Harness`/`CommandRunner` traits, `HarnessTask`, `HarnessResult`, `HarnessCapabilities`, prompt and QUESTION-line helpers) plus in-memory fakes, and the first concrete adapter, `dsh_harness`, which runs `dsh --profile headless --json -` through a `CommandRunner`, parses newline-delimited JSON events, and probes the binary's version, headless help and profile dump. The adapter guards the run with git status/head/branch checks, keeps credentials out of git's environment, and reports capabilities as supported/unsupported/unknown rather than assuming them.",
